{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"zongshi-e-o026","title":"皎尝以小故与甘宁忿争，或以谏宁","accounts":[{"id":"zongshi-a-603db16643997e35c307","label":"正文","text":"皎尝以小故与甘宁忿争，或以谏宁","evidence":["zongshi-q-e46dce1fca6feb48c5cb"]},{"id":"zongshi-a-4ca49bfe845b3550ec24","label":"正文","text":"宁曰：臣、子一例，征虏虽公子，何可专行侮人邪！吾值明主，但当输效力命以报所天，诚不能随俗屈曲矣","evidence":["zongshi-q-82bdc632d937118fbace"]},{"id":"zongshi-a-23ff648cff6458afca8e","label":"正文","text":"权闻之，以书让皎：责其与甘兴霸饮因酒发作侵陵其人；教以居敬行简、爱人多容，宜追前愆深自咎责；今烦诸葛子瑜重宣吾意","evidence":["zongshi-q-70b26d078f8749f5fc15"]},{"id":"zongshi-a-bfc2eb3c9ee917480d8f","label":"正文","text":"皎得书上疏陈谢，遂与宁结厚","evidence":["zongshi-q-4813402efef061b74473"]}],"participants":[{"person":"zhouyu-p0054","role":"忿争者；宁语所指之征虏公子（背景）；受书者；陈谢结好者","evidence":["zongshi-q-e46dce1fca6feb48c5cb","zongshi-q-82bdc632d937118fbace","zongshi-q-70b26d078f8749f5fc15","zongshi-q-4813402efef061b74473"]},{"person":"gan-ning","role":"忿争者；自陈者；书中所护之兴霸（背景）；与之结厚者","evidence":["zongshi-q-e46dce1fca6feb48c5cb","zongshi-q-82bdc632d937118fbace","zongshi-q-70b26d078f8749f5fc15","zongshi-q-4813402efef061b74473"]},{"person":"sun-quan","role":"宁所谓明主、所天（背景）；致书责让者","evidence":["zongshi-q-82bdc632d937118fbace","zongshi-q-70b26d078f8749f5fc15"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0002","role":"受命重宣吾意之子瑜（背景）","evidence":["zongshi-q-70b26d078f8749f5fc15"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"原文时间表达；各账户以所引文献为准。","evidence":["zongshi-q-e46dce1fca6feb48c5cb","zongshi-q-82bdc632d937118fbace","zongshi-q-70b26d078f8749f5fc15","zongshi-q-4813402efef061b74473"]},"ordering_evidence":"zongshi-q-e46dce1fca6feb48c5cb","source_order":[51,39,0],"order":9131}],"persons":[{"id":"gan-ning","name":"甘宁","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"mingdi-p0002","name":"诸葛瑾","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"sun-quan","name":"孙权","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"zhouyu-p0054","name":"孙皎","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"zongshi-q-4813402efef061b74473","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-bff10f0ab11890b1b8e7","layer":"original","quote":"皎得书，上疏陈谢，遂与宁结厚","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":40,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":14},{"id":"zongshi-q-70b26d078f8749f5fc15","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-0358de1fa72c0ebbce9f","layer":"original","quote":"权闻之，以书让皎曰〖11〗：“自吾与北方为敌，中间十年〖12〗；初时相持，年小，今者且三十矣！孔子言‘三十而立’，非但谓五经也。授卿以精兵，委卿以大任，都护诸将于千里之外；欲使如楚任昭奚恤〖13〗，扬威于北境：非徒相使逞私志而已。近闻卿与甘兴霸饮〖14〗，因酒发作，侵陵其人；其人求属吕蒙督中。此人虽粗豪〖15〗，有不如人意时；然其较略大丈夫也〖16〗：吾亲之者，非私之也。我亲爱之，卿疏憎之；卿所为每与吾违，其可久乎？夫居敬而行简，可以临民；爱人多容〖17〗，可以得众。二者尚不能知，安可董督在远，御寇济难乎？卿行长大，特受重任；上有远方瞻望之视，下有部曲朝夕从事：何可恣意有盛怒邪？人谁无过？贵其能改；宜追前愆〖18〗，深自咎责！今故烦诸葛子瑜重宣吾意〖19〗。临书摧怆〖20〗，心悲泪下","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":39,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":346},{"id":"zongshi-q-82bdc632d937118fbace","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-b7aba15cfa849b0e74e4","layer":"original","quote":"宁曰：“臣、子一例〖8〗：征虏虽公子〖9〗，何可专行侮人邪！吾值明主，但当输效力命〖10〗，以报所天；诚不能随俗屈曲矣","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":38,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":18,"end":77},{"id":"zongshi-q-e46dce1fca6feb48c5cb","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-b7aba15cfa849b0e74e4","layer":"original","quote":"尝以小故与甘宁忿争〖7〗，或以谏宁","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":38,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":17}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
